              <groupfilter function='member' level='[:Measure Names]' member='&quot;[federated.1w5o5p21a6qqgu10i7r2a0hdo138].[usr:CPO COMPS EU (copia)_726486942173065221:qk]&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[:Measure Names]' member='&quot;[federated.1w5o5p21a6qqgu10i7r2a0hdo138].[usr:Calculation_796855685241364492:qk]&quot;' />
